# A low-contrast platform: the effective index sits close to the cladding.
# Reference: SciPy root of the dispersion relation.
title 800 nm silicon nitride slab in oxide
stack core=0.8
materials core=sin
grating angle=10 etch=0.4
sweep 1.45 1.65 201
expect n_full 1.88355739 2e-07
expect n_etched 1.74339491 2e-07
expect n_grating 1.81347615 2e-07
expect group_index 2.04615271 0.0002
